# GeoKernel test asset: axis-aligned cube [0,2]^3
# 8 vertices, 6 CCW (outward-facing) quads -> 12 triangles after fan triangulation
mtllib cube.mtl
o cube

v 0 0 0
v 2 0 0
v 2 2 0
v 0 2 0
v 0 0 2
v 2 0 2
v 2 2 2
v 0 2 2

vn 0 0 -1
vn 0 0 1
vn 0 -1 0
vn 0 1 0
vn -1 0 0
vn 1 0 0

usemtl default
s off
f 1//1 4//1 3//1 2//1
f 5//2 6//2 7//2 8//2
f 1//3 2//3 6//3 5//3
f 4//4 8//4 7//4 3//4
f 1//5 5//5 8//5 4//5
f 2//6 3//6 7//6 6//6
